<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche Shanghai venture opens new plant.</title>
<headline>Roche Shanghai venture opens new plant.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said its Roche Taishan (Shanghai) Vitamin Product Ltd joint venture opened a new vitamin pre-mix plant in the Shanghai Xinhuo Development Zone.</p>
<p>The joint venture is with the domestic vitamin A producer, Shanghai No.6 Pharmaceuticals Factory, Roche said.</p>
<p>It said the joint venture company mainly produces vitamin A for pharmaceuticals, food and feed as well as pre-mixes for feed use. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
